      "text": "SNES灵感的手绘2.5D像素世界",
      "dimension": "画风",
      "excerpt": "The Rangers in the South is a PIXELART ACTION ROGUELIKE RPG set in a beautiful 2.5D world inspired by the SNES classics.",
